abstract: >-
  Sol Next 8.0.1 (ai.sol.next, Build 801) is an open-source, zero-built-in-key (BYOK)
  grounded multimodal Android 10-16 OS agent built upon and paying tribute to
  wangzan101/Mika (Apache-2.0). It combines 72ms Tier-0A zero-token native System APIs,
  120+ app deep-link teleports (<250ms), 10 orthogonal typed OS tools (SolGroundedAgent)
  with live #1..#N Accessibility handles and <2ms zero-cache state fingerprinting,
  on-demand 64ms 1:1 Set-of-Mark vision, a Rust v5.00 16KB page-aligned JNI kernel
  (-74% to -97% UI tree pruning for on-device PII minimization), verified 1:1 physical
  Display 0 background VirtualDisplay cloning (0.0px drift), 9 WeChat 8.0.80 hardening
  fixes (9.5s first-try login, 8/8 first-try, zero duplicate sends), Android KeyStore
  hardware encryption, carrier-grade AI calling, and zero-dependency CLI (--json) +
  stdio MCP Server integration.
